king side  is sanitary items and dead animals which  isn't pleasant for us to find when we're  inspecting all the people that certain  disability enterprises who have to hand  sort the recycling either okay  Awesome's springtime's coming so we'll  have lambs or little lambs it's quite  upsetting for the guys to see a puppy  come down the line they don't understand  how someone could be so terrible and  just chuck it in the bin and see the  baring it like most so if you're unsure  of what you can put in your yellow  recycling but there's a handy to stick  here under the lip which tells you what  can go in and what can't go in or if you  have an item and you're really not sure  if it can be recyclable or not just pop  it in your ribbon or if you're still  really unsure and you would like some  more information feel free to contact  council
 

